    text: "Obioma Chukwuike is an intersex and human rights activist, researcher and environmental conservation expert. They are the Founder and Executive Director of Intersex Nigeria, an organization focused on intersex issues that advocate for the visibility and promotion of the rights of intersex people in Nigeria.\n Their activism and advocacy are aimed at promoting the visibility, respect, and recognition of the rights of intersex people in Nigeria and around the world. \nIssues of healthcare, SRHR, empowerment, social injustice, and well-being faced by intersex people drive their mission at Intersex Nigeria. They belong to several national, regional, and international committees that work to promote the rights and well-being of intersex people."
